<title>USA: Quality Semiconductor names Goldsberry CFO.</title>
<headline>Quality Semiconductor names Goldsberry CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quality Semiconductor Inc said it named John Goldsberry as new vice president of finance and chief financial officer, replacing Stephen Vonderach, who is resigning to join a privately held technology firm.</p>
<p>Goldsberry most recently served as chief financial officer of DSP Group Inc a developer of digital signal processors and speech comprehension algorithms.</p>
